      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Corrected WALK CYCLE sprite sheet for Hollow Sentinel, hand-painted 2D game prototype. Reference1 model proposal identity ONLY; match second figure RIGHT SIDE PROFILE, amber eyes/one amber chest crystal, angular bluegray stone armor, brown root joints, moss shoulders, no weapon. Exactly SIX full-body SIDE PROFILE frames in 3columns x2rows on1536x1024, each512cell, left-right top-bottom. Camera strictly PURE RIGHT SIDE view, nose always pointsRIGHT, identical head/torso orientation and scale, each guardian body330px tall with70px empty transparent padding. No threequarter/front view. Two distinct legs and arms in every frame. NEAR leg/arm slightly lighter stone, FAR leg/arm darker cool shadow, same design throughout, so one can track them. Critical UNAMBIGUOUS ALTERNATING stride, far leg must move forward in middle of cycle. Frame1 CONTACT A: LIGHT nearleg extended FORWARD RIGHT with foot flat, DARK farleg stretched BACK LEFT toe on ground; neararm swingsBACKleft, fararm swingsFORWARDright. Frame2 DOWN/PASS: LIGHT nearleg vertical weightbearing under hips; DARK farleg knee bent foot raised passing behind it; arms pass close to torso. Frame3 CONTACT B: DARK FARLEG extended FORWARD RIGHT footflat, LIGHT nearleg stretched BACK LEFT toe on ground; LIGHT neararm swingsFORWARDright, darkfararm BACKleft. Frame4 DOWN B: DARK farleg vertical weightbearing under hips, LIGHT nearleg bent lifted behind body; arms close to torso. Frame5 PASS A: LIGHT nearleg knee lifted and foot passing FORWARD RIGHT of supporting darkfarleg; lightneararm movesBACKleft. Frame6 RETURN CONTACT A: LIGHT nearleg extended FORWARD RIGHT and darkfarleg stretched BACK LEFT as frame1; opposite arms. These are a continuous alternating walk cycle, NOT six repeats of one leg stepping. Keep feet close to baseline except passing lifted foot, no huge high-knee pose. Genuine transparent background, opaque character interior. No ground/castshadow/scenery, no haze/glow outside chest, no labels/text/borders/othercharacters or extra anatomy. All parts fit own512cell.",
